{'symbol': 'HII', 'date': '2021-08-19 11:05:00', 'title': 'HUNTINGTON INGALLS INDUSTRIES COMPLETES ACQUISITION OF\xa0ALION SCIENCE AND TECHNOLOGY', 'text': 'NEWPORT NEWS, VA., AUG. 19, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- \xa0HUNTINGTON INGALLS INDUSTRIES (NYSE:HII) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT HAS COMPLETED THE ACQUISITION OF ALION SCIENCE AND TECHNOLOGY, A TECHNOLOGY-DRIVEN SOLUTIONS PROVIDER LOCATED IN MCLEAN, VIRGINIA, FROM VERITAS CAPITAL, A LEADING INVESTOR IN COMPANIES OPERATING AT THE INTERSECTION OF TECHNOLOGY AND GOVERNMENT.'}